00:00:06.615 --> 00:00:10.915
(deep beat music)

00:00:13.461 --> 00:00:15.702
Everybody, this is Gary Vay-ner-chuk

00:00:15.702 --> 00:00:19.986
and you're watching episode
15 of the #AskGaryVee Show.

00:00:19.986 --> 00:00:22.250
Fun fact of the number 15,

00:00:22.250 --> 00:00:24.484
